<article class="env-definition" id="044J">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/044J">Definition <span data-tag="044J">78.19.1</span>.</a> Let $B \to S$ and the pre-relation $j : R \to U \times _ B U$ be as above. In this setting the <em>quotient sheaf $U/R$</em> associated to $j$ is the sheafification of the presheaf (<a href="/tag/044I" data-tag="044I">78.19.0.1</a>) on $(\mathit{Sch}/S)_{fppf}$. If $j : R \to U \times _ B U$ comes from the action of a group algebraic space $G$ over $B$ on $U$ as in Lemma <a href="/tag/0444" data-tag="0444">78.15.1</a> then we denote the quotient sheaf $U/G$. </p>
</article>